        "original_id": "6ee0c4d7-8bbe-5902-89aa-663a888b9f2d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Marion, Indiana; Henderson, North Carolina; United States\n- Companies: Five Points Mall; North Park Mall; Carson's; Roses Discount Store; Roses Stores; Ruler Foods; Jo-Ann; Subway Restaurant; Buffalo Wild Wings\n- Topics: shopping malls; anchor stores; outparcel properties; discount stores\n\nFacts:\n- Five Points Mall, formerly North Park Mall, opened in 1978 as an enclosed shopping mall in Marion, Indiana.\n- Five Points Mall has Carson's and Roses Discount Store as its anchor stores.\n- Five Points Mall has outparcel properties including a free-standing Ruler Foods grocery store, Jo-Ann, Subway Restaurant, and Buffalo Wild Wings.\n- Roses Stores was originally known as Rose's 5¢ 10¢ 25¢ Stores.\n- Roses Stores is a regional discount store in the United States headquartered in Henderson, North Carolina.",
